    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.760" end="00:02.260" ttm:agent="v1">Me not working hard?</p>
      <p begin="00:02.220" end="00:04.160" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah right picture that with a Kodak</p>
      <p begin="00:04.160" end="00:05.980" ttm:agent="v1">And, better yet, go to Times Square</p>
      <p begin="00:05.980" end="00:07.760" ttm:agent="v1">Take a picture of me with a Kodak</p>
      <p begin="00:07.760" end="00:09.750" ttm:agent="v1">Took my life from negative to positive</p>
      <p begin="00:09.750" end="00:11.330" ttm:agent="v1">And I just want y'all know that</p>
      <p begin="00:11.330" end="00:12.940" ttm:agent="v1">And tonight, let's enjoy life</p>
      <p begin="00:12.940" end="00:15.100" ttm:agent="v1">Pitbull, Nayer, Ne-Yo, tell us right</p>
      <p begin="00:15.100" end="00:19.880" ttm:agent="v1">Tonight, I want all of you tonight</p>
      <p begin="00:19.880" end="00:23.940" ttm:agent="v1">Give me everything tonight</p>
      <p begin="00:23.940" end="00:28.690" ttm:agent="v1">For all we know we might not get tomorrow</p>
      <p begin="00:28.690" end="00:30.190" ttm:agent="v1">Let's do it tonight</p>
      <p begin="00:30.030" end="00:31.880" ttm:agent="v1">(Don't care what they say</p>
      <p begin="00:31.880" end="00:33.710" ttm:agent="v1">All the games they play</p>
      <p begin="00:33.710" end="00:35.470" ttm:agent="v1">Nothing is enough</p>
      <p begin="00:35.470" end="00:36.970" ttm:agent="v1">Till they handle love)</p>
      <p begin="00:36.860" end="00:38.360" ttm:agent="v1">Let's do it tonight</p>
      <p begin="00:37.860" end="00:39.360" ttm:agent="v1">(I want you tonight</p>
      <p begin="00:39.220" end="00:41.150" ttm:agent="v1">I want you to stay</p>
      <p begin="00:41.150" end="00:42.930" ttm:agent="v1">I want you tonight)</p>
      <p begin="00:42.930" end="00:45.820" ttm:agent="v1">Grab somebody sexy, tell 'em hey</p>
      <p begin="00:45.820" end="00:49.440" ttm:agent="v1">Give me everything tonight</p>
