      <p begin="00:59.610" end="01:01.110" ttm:agent="v1">Take advantage of tonight</p>
      <p begin="01:00.920" end="01:03.730" ttm:agent="v1">Cause tomorrow I'm off to Dubai to perform for a princess</p>
      <p begin="01:03.730" end="01:05.890" ttm:agent="v1">But tonight, I can make you my queen</p>
      <p begin="01:05.890" end="01:07.390" ttm:agent="v1">And make love to you endless</p>
      <p begin="01:07.280" end="01:09.070" ttm:agent="v1">This is insane: the way the name growin'</p>
