      <p begin="01:10.860" end="01:12.700" ttm:agent="v1">So, I'm tiptoein', to keep flowin'</p>
      <p begin="01:12.700" end="01:14.930" ttm:agent="v1">I got it locked up like Lindsay Lohan</p>
      <p begin="01:14.930" end="01:16.940" ttm:agent="v1">Put it on my life, baby</p>
