      <p begin="01:18.560" end="01:21.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Can't promise tomorrow, but I promise tonight (dale)</p>
      <p begin="01:21.990" end="01:23.780" ttm:agent="v1">Excuse me</p>
